# Arashin Sunshield: "{W}, {T}: Tap target creature." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with no card in any graveyard, so its enter
# trigger has nothing to exile. Bot2 casts Memnite on turn 2. On turn 3 the Sunshield, no longer summoning sick, taps Memnite
# (it or Memnite: two candidates) with a Mox Pearl's {W}. The Sunshield is tapped as a cost, so it cannot do it again (the
# refusal), and Memnite stays tapped for the turn.

